n  clark county  ballots are scanned if a machine rejects  the signature due to significant and  multiple differences  and then if two election workers also  reject it  the registrar's office is advised to  contact the voter  the voter has the opportunity then to  make sure the ballot is then counted  by answering three personal questions  through the registrar on the phone  or using an app through the secretary of  state's office  and remember there are 48 early voting  sites throughout clark county  and 125 of those in-person sites but  that's just for election day  don't expect that we're going to get the  final results though  on november 3rd of course they have to  count in all these mail-in ballots they  have to wait for them to arrive  so it could be up to a week before  everything is counted and set in stone  eight news now is here to help you if we  didn't answer  any questions you may have please let us  know we'll continue to update you on air  and at eight newsnow dot com
 

